{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "explainer.accountId.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share your Account ID so friends can reach you. You can also pick a username to make you easier to find."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparte tu ID de cuenta para que tus amigos puedan contactarte. También puedes elegir un nombre de usuario para que sea más fácil encontrarte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享你的账号 ID，朋友就能联系你。你也可以设置一个用户名，让别人更容易找到你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享你的帳號 ID，朋友就能聯絡你。你也可以設定使用者名稱，讓別人更容易找到你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.accountId.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Account ID is your address"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu ID de cuenta es tu dirección"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号 ID 就是你的地址"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帳號 ID 就是你的地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.intro.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim works a bit differently from other chat apps. Here is what to know."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim funciona un poco distinto de otras apps de chat. Esto es lo que debes saber."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim 和其他聊天应用有点不一样。下面是你需要知道的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim 和其他聊天 App 有點不一樣。以下是你需要知道的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.lockedMessages.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Messages are end-to-end encrypted. Only the people in the chat can read them. Not even the server can."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los mensajes tienen cifrado de extremo a extremo. Solo las personas del chat pueden leerlos. Ni siquiera el servidor puede."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息经过端到端加密。只有聊天里的人能看。连服务器也看不了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訊息採用端對端加密。只有聊天中的人能讀取。連伺服器也不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.lockedMessages.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your messages are locked"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus mensajes están bloqueados"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的消息已锁定"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的訊息已鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.noPhoneNumber.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You don’t need a phone number or email. Just pick a name. gim gives you an Account ID."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No necesitas número de teléfono ni correo. Solo elige un nombre. gim te da un ID de cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不需要手机号码或电子邮箱。只要取个名字。gim 会给你一个账号 ID。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不需要手機號碼或電子郵件。只要取個名稱。gim 會給你一個帳號 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.noPhoneNumber.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No phone number needed"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No necesitas número de teléfono"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不需要手机号码"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不需要手機號碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.onYourDevices.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account is kept on your devices, not on a server. Want to use it somewhere else? Link another device."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu cuenta se guarda en tus dispositivos, no en un servidor. ¿Quieres usarla en otro sitio? Vincula otro dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的账号保存在你的设备上，而不是服务器上。想在别的地方用？关联另一台设备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的帳號存放在你的裝置上，而不是伺服器上。想在其他地方使用？連結另一台裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.onYourDevices.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account lives on your devices"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu cuenta vive en tus dispositivos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的账号保存在你的设备上"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的帳號存放在你的裝置上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.recoveryKey.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lost all your devices? Your recovery key and Account ID bring your account back. Old chats don’t come back. Keep the key secret and safe. Never show it to anyone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Perdiste todos tus dispositivos? Tu clave de recuperación y tu ID de cuenta te devuelven tu cuenta. Los chats antiguos no vuelven. Guarda la clave en secreto y en un lugar seguro. Nunca se la enseñes a nadie."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备全丢了？用恢复密钥和账号 ID 就能找回账号。以前的聊天不会回来。请把密钥保密并妥善保管。不要给任何人看。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置全都遺失了？用復原金鑰和帳號 ID 就能找回帳號。以前的聊天不會回來。請把金鑰保密並妥善保管。絕對不要給任何人看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.recoveryKey.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your recovery key is a spare key"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu clave de recuperación es una llave de repuesto"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复密钥是一把备用钥匙"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "復原金鑰是一把備用鑰匙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "explainer.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How gim works"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo funciona gim"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim 如何运作"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "gim 如何運作"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
